              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "No. Currently, we have a 'virtual' catalog. In order to ensure that our customers have access to the most current styles, prices, sizes, and overall selection, we do not publish a catalog that you may purchase directly from us. Plus, with all the styles that we carry, a catalog would be as big as a phone book! If there is a particular shoe or style of shoe that you are interested in, please feel free to contact us and we will be happy to help you locate it.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "textStyle",
                      "attrs": {
                        "color": ""
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
